       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Arq Grid has received a patch, modifying the prices of the Parry skill tree.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased cost of Parry Window (was 1000, now 1500)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "Increased cost of Parry Damage (was 750, now 2000)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "balance"
      },
      {
       "text": "In addition to these changes, the following bugs have been derezzed:",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where players could potentially become progress blocked.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed an issue where players and enemy Light Cycles could fall out of the map.",
